  - m_Id: 33956972290187264
    m_Localized: "Ten stw\xF3r <style=\"Blue\">zaatakuje</style> mystlinga z przodu
      i zada mu pi\u0119\u0107 razy {Action.Power} p. <style=\"Blue\">obra\u017Ce\u0144</style>"
